# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# Generate a free key at https://web3forms.com using the inbox that should
# receive enquiries (sensanindiaprojects@gmail.com), then copy this file to
# .env and paste the key below. Without a key the form tells visitors to email
# the company directly — it never pretends a message was sent.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
